Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Reject empty product reviews (add check)

Customers can currently post reviews with no text at all. This adds a check
script that expects PUT /rest/products/:id/reviews to reject an empty message
with a 4xx and still accept normal reviews with 201.

The check fails today. Please implement the validation in
routes/createProductReviews.ts so it passes, and update the contributor notes.
